Bernie Sanders Attacks Musk For Becoming a Trillionaire 

@RubinReport: It's so extraordinary to me that people are upset over this... I don't have less now that Elon is a trillionaire.

@jeffreytucker: Let's be clear, Elon is an American treasure! He was the one leader in America during the lockdowns that stood up to the Covid machine and said "No, I will not shut down my factories. I'll sleep on the factory floor..." He also saved free speech in America.

